mming task and describe the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check against the stated objective and mention a limitation, error source or safety/design trade-off.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1. Confirm against official teaching material before use."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning and purpose (2 marks):** Marwadi University Faculty of Diploma Studies Information and Communication Technology A appears in “Instruction Set”. Define its role and features, relate it to Marwadi University Faculty of Diploma Studies Information and Communication Technology Assembly Language Programming Basics, Classification of Instructions, Instruction Set, Instruction and data Formats, provide a practical example and state one process/design check or limitation. Confirm the details against official teaching material.\n\n**Principles/procedure (3 marks):** Explain the concept in logical order and relate it to Marwadi University Faculty of Diploma Studies Information and Communication Technology Assembly Language Programming Basics, Classification of Instructions, Instruction Set, Instruction and data Formats, Addressing Modes. Include the relevant conditions, components, operating variables or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a concrete Microprocessor and Assembly Language Programming task and describe the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check against the stated objective and mention a limitation, error source or safety/design trade-off.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1. Confirm against official teaching material before use."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning and purpose (2 marks):** Memory: Classification and characteristics. 8085 microprocessor Architecture Introductio appears in “Evolution of Microprocessors, Microprocessor Bus organization, Operations of”. Define its role and features, r